14", "updated": "2026-11-14", "kind": "hunch", "tier": "T6", "status": "live", "vivid": "Expected to reduce to the same deficiency count. Recorded so nobody spends an afternoon on it.", "test": "Write the rank formula and compare with O (3.1).", "links": [{"to": "m.step.A", "rel": "instance-of"}, {"to": "src.agent.dep", "rel": "cites"}, {"to": "wp.P", "rel": "suggests"}], "source": "labyrinth"}, {"id": "k.A.2", "title": "roots not on a common face", "statement": "For every simple 2-coloured triangulation some triple of roots of three colours, not necessarily the corners of a face, admits two disjoint states. The categorical agent tested the two-root version: the obstruction moves and the recovery lemma fails without a root face (A.x2).", "where": ["research/2026-11-14_fable_dependency-graph/skeleton.md G2"], "tags": ["step A"], "created": "2026-11-14", "updated": "2026-11-14", "kind": "conjecture", "tier": "T5", "status": "open", "test": "On the smallest black-inner example (9 vertices, lim/examples/t9_0.json, outer face 2) enumerate all root triples and count pairs.", "links": [{"to": "m.step.A", "rel": "instance-of"}, {"to": "src.agent.dep", "rel": "cites"}, {"to": "wp.P", "rel": "suggests"}], "source": "labyrinth"}, {"id": "c.A.4", "title": "pair counts depend on the root", "statement": "In plantri graph 12_2 one black root has 9 states, 10 pairs, 8 tree matchings; every other black root has 9, 2, 2.", "where": ["research/2026-11-14_astra_limits/data/roots.json"], "tags": ["step A"], "created": "2026-11-14", "updated": "2026-11-14", "kind": "evidence", "tier": "T4", "status": "computed", "evidence": ["research/2026-11-14_astra_limits/data/roots.json"], "links": [{"to": "m.step.A", "rel": "instance-of"}, {"to": "src.agent.lim", "rel": "cites"}, {"to": "wp.P", "rel": "tests"}], "source": "labyrinth"}, {"id": "th.B.O", "title": "Euler + side count + bijection, on triangles", "statement": "B + W = 2I + h - 2, 3(B - W) = 2l - h and B = I + l give 2l - h = -3. T adds t