, "statement": "The unsigned generating polynomial of tree matchings is real stable, like spanning-tree polynomials.", "where": ["research/2026-11-14_sol_route-algebra/PROOF.md 3"], "tags": ["step N"], "created": "2026-11-14", "updated": "2026-11-14", "kind": "deadend", "tier": null, "status": "refuted", "lesson": "Projecting onto matchings destroys stability.", "note": "Smallest known counterexample: Cube: abc + def vanishes at a = b = c = e^{i pi/6}, d = e = f = i.", "links": [{"to": "m.step.N", "rel": "instance-of"}, {"to": "src.agent.alg", "rel": "cites"}], "source": "labyrinth"}, {"id": "h.N.1", "title": "mixed determinant with positive curvature", "statement": "Z = [prod z_t] det(sum z_t M_t) is n! times a mixed discriminant of rank-two blocks. Prove it nonzero from structural hypotheses.", "where": ["research/2026-11-14_fable_dependency-graph/skeleton.md D1; research/2026-11-14_sol_machinery-literature/ROUTE-IDEAS.md 1"], "tags": ["step N"], "created": "2026-11-14", "updated": "2026-11-14", "kind": "hunch", "tier": "T6", "status": "live", "vivid": "At a = 1 the matrix is the adjacency matrix of T[X] with a U(1) connection of holonomy i around black and -i around white triangles.", "test": "Compute rank(sum over S of W_t) against |S| on cases with and without pairs; look for a non-diagonal normalisation.", "links": [{"to": "m.step.N", "rel": "instance-of"}, {"to": "src.agent.dep", "rel": "cites"}, {"to": "src.agent.mach", "rel": "cites"}, {"to": "wp.N", "rel": "suggests"}], "source": "labyrinth"}, {"id": "h.N.2", "title": "2-adic evaluation at z = -1", "statement": "Choose weights with every L+ - L- odd and evaluate T's polynomial at -1.", "where": ["research/2026-11-14_fable_dependency-graph/skeleton.md D3"], "tags": ["step N"], "created": "2026-11-14", "updated": "2026-11-14", "kind": "hunch", "tier": "T6", "status": "live", "vivid": "A count mod powers of 2 that sees the weights.", "test": "Check on the examples whether such weights exist and the value is n